{
  "file": "Guidance for national",
  "page": 97,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        36.0,
        21.884788513183594,
        63.09400177001953,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "Second",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.09400177001953,
        21.884788513183594,
        86.86299896240234,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "edition",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        81.5599365234375,
        222.859375,
        98.2879409790039
      ],
      "text": "Training and evaluation",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        105.2994384765625,
        513.4950561523438,
        118.65093994140625
      ],
      "text": "Training and supervision of public and private health workers will be needed to: increase",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        121.29595947265625,
        513.3914794921875,
        134.6474609375
      ],
      "text": "case finding of child TB cases in the community; improve the management of children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        137.29248046875,
        513.4833984375,
        150.64398193359375
      ],
      "text": "with TB; increase child contact screening and preventive therapy; and improve recording",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        153.28900146484375,
        513.4259033203125,
        166.6405029296875
      ],
      "text": "and reporting practices so that better data will become available for monitoring progress.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        177.79547119140625,
        513.3798217773438,
        191.14697265625
      ],
      "text": "Training is a critical tool for addressing the wide policy-practice gap that currently exists.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        193.7919921875,
        513.3915405273438,
        207.14349365234375
      ],
      "text": "WHO has developed and field-tested training and evaluation tools that are consistent",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        209.78851318359375,
        372.4473876953125,
        223.1400146484375
      ],
      "text": "with this updated guidance and are freely available on-line",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        372.19439697265625,
        209.78851318359375,
        510.24041748046875,
        223.1400146484375
      ],
      "text": "www.who.int/tb/challenges/",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        225.7850341796875,
        142.34390258789062,
        239.13653564453125
      ],
      "text": "children/en/",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        142.34390258789062,
        225.7850341796875,
        145.54090881347656,
        239.13653564453125
      ],
      "text": ".",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        250.29156494140625,
        277.1468505859375,
        263.64306640625
      ],
      "text": "Important objectives of training are to:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        272.611328125,
        398.8699035644531,
        286.07781982421875
      ],
      "text": "increase case-finding of child TB cases in the community; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        292.08062744140625,
        346.2689208984375,
        305.547119140625
      ],
      "text": "improve the management of children with TB; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        311.5499267578125,
        487.8799133300781,
        325.01641845703125
      ],
      "text": "increase implementation of child contact screening and preventive therapy; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        331.01922607421875,
        513.38720703125,
        344.4857177734375
      ],
      "text": "provide accurate data on childhood TB for NTPs for purposes of monitoring and  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.4894027709961,
        345.417236328125,
        174.15988159179688,
        358.76873779296875
      ],
      "text": "evaluation.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        367.0832214355469,
        414.52142333984375,
        380.4347229003906
      ],
      "text": "The main focus of the training is for three likely common scenarios:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        389.3924255371094,
        296.2209167480469,
        402.8589172363281
      ],
      "text": "the child with suspected TB disease; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        408.8617248535156,
        326.01739501953125,
        422.3282165527344
      ],
      "text": "the child treated for TB in the community; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        428.9309997558594,
        339.02386474609375,
        442.3974914550781
      ],
      "text": "the child who is a close contact of a TB case. -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        450.59698486328125,
        513.3754272460938,
        463.948486328125
      ],
      "text": "The NTP needs to facilitate training for the following target audiences to enable them",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        466.5934753417969,
        269.0463562011719,
        479.9449768066406
      ],
      "text": "to implement childhood TB activities:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        488.9042053222656,
        513.4099731445312,
        502.3706970214844
      ],
      "text": "health workers at secondary- and primary-level facilities that provide care for sick  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.4894027709961,
        502.70416259765625,
        162.45289611816406,
        516.0556640625
      ],
      "text": "children;",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        522.1735229492188,
        510.1783142089844,
        535.6400146484375
      ],
      "text": "health workers involved in the management of adult TB cases in the community; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        541.642822265625,
        513.467529296875,
        555.1093139648438
      ],
      "text": "health workers who are involved in the management of mothers and children  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.4894027709961,
        555.4428100585938,
        165.0059051513672,
        568.7943115234375
      ],
      "text": "with HIV;",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        574.912109375,
        513.4560546875,
        588.3786010742188
      ],
      "text": "community health workers and volunteers and treatment support groups (who  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.4894027709961,
        589.3101196289062,
        336.4248962402344,
        602.66162109375
      ],
      "text": "carry out contact tracing in the community).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        619.5404663085938,
        125.70940399169922,
        636.396484375
      ],
      "text": "8.4\t I",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        125.92539978027344,
        623.5473022460938,
        218.85179138183594,
        635.3464965820312
      ],
      "text": "ntegrated care",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        644.0892333984375,
        513.35693359375,
        657.4407348632812
      ],
      "text": "Children with TB often do not present, and are not managed, within the context of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        660.0857543945312,
        513.426025390625,
        673.437255859375
      ],
      "text": "specific TB care services but rather in the context of services that provide care to the sick",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        676.0822143554688,
        513.4373779296875,
        689.4337158203125
      ],
      "text": "child, including maternal and child health services and HIV care services. An important",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        692.0787353515625,
        513.4261474609375,
        705.4302368164062
      ],
      "text": "step towards improving the prevention and management of TB in children is the provision",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        708.0752563476562,
        175.55589294433594,
        721.4267578125
      ],
      "text": "of integrated care.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        14.202799797058105,
        805.8439331054688,
        36.44280242919922,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "78",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}